#Linux
Zotuluka lembani: (Lamulo ls -la), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: (Njira /home gabor Desktop), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: (Njira /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ((Lamulo ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ((Lamulo do: ['this'], ndi: ['that'])), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ((Njira go: ['here'], ndi: ['there'])), mzere-watsopano.